          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Of  late,  the  study  of solid  material  combustion    in zero  gravity  (more  accurately,    in microgravity)      is becoming\nof great  importance    in Russia   (refs.",
