        },
        {
          "text": "For PMMA,   with  a low oxygen  index  of\n 15.5 percent,   the  limiting  flow  velocity   is less than  0.5  cm/s:  and  for glass-epoxy    composite,   with  a high oxygen\nindex  of 19 percent,   the  limiting  flow  velocity   is greater  than  15 crn/s.",
