        {
          "text": "When  the concurrent-air-flow      velocity\ndecreases   but  is not  less  than  V,,,,, the combustion    intensity   decreases   in microgravity,    similar  to a thermally   thin\n\nNASA/CR--    1999-209405                                  2",
