        },
        {
          "text": "Thedescribedcharacteristicofnonmetallic-materialcombustionenablesthepotentialdevelopmentofafire-\nsafetysystemforaspacestationthatisbasedonair-flowshutoffinthespace-stationcompartment.Thissystemis\nreliableatalowoxygenconcentration(C = 21percent).Thisecologicallysafefire-safetyandfire-alarmsystem\n(i.e.,onethatdoesnotautomaticallyreleaseanatmospheric-pollutingagentforsuppression)hasbeenimplemented\nontheFGB  module  of  the International   Space  Station.",
