        },
        {
          "text": "GROUNDTESTINGFORTHE SPACE  EXPERIMENT   ON MATERIAL  FLAMMABILITY\n\n     The  Contract  NAS3-97160    Statement   of Work   states  that  the main  objective   of the  \"Material   Flammability\n Evaluation   In Space\"   U.S./Russia    Joint  Project   is to assess  the  effect  of  air flow  of low  velocity  on the combustion\n of selected   U.S.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 8,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "materials   in long-duration    microgravity    in the Skorost   apparatus   on OS Mir.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 8,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Material   combustion\n during  the  testing  occurs   in concurrent   flow  (with  respect   to the  flame-propagation      direction).",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 8,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  following   tasks\n are  to be accomplished:\n\n       •    Define  a minimum   limiting  flow  velocity   (V,.,)  to  sustain  material  combustion.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 8,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "•    Define  how  the flame-spread    rate  (V_:) depends  on  the  concurrent   flow  velocity   (V).",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 8,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "•    Review   the  results  obtained   in space  experiment    against   the  ground-testing     results.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 8,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  experience   of the  first and second   series  of Skorost  apparatus   operations    in 1994 and  1996 showed   that  the\n apparatus   cannot  be used  to obtain  combustion   parameters    (V,, m,V F) for a wide  range  of materials   due  to its limita-\n tions.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 8,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Measurements    of V,m and  Vvare  possible   in the microgravity   environment    of spacecraft,   however,    if the\n material   is flammable   in the given  oxygen   concentration    in the  spacecraft   compartment    at the time  of the space\n experiment   and  if the flow  velocity   in the  apparatus  chamber    is higher  than  a limiting   velocity   for the  material.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 8,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
