          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "These  conditions  may  be summarized   by the  following:  C  >__C,m;and V >__V,,m.Cox(%)  is the oxygen   concentration\n in the  spacecraft   compartment   atmosphere    and,  hence,  in the  Skorost  apparatus;  C,m (%)  is the  limiting  oxygen  con-\ncentration    for the  material;  V (cm/s)   is the flow  velocity   in the  apparatus   chamber;   and  V,,., (cm/s)   is the  limiting\n velocity   for the  material.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 8,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
