          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "For  the LOI  test procedure    at White  Sands  (candle-like   combustion,   downward   flame  propagation),    the  sample\nlength  was  increased   to 150 mm.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
