          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  burning   criterion   is the same  as\ndescribed   above   for  C_l.,-------eithera length  of the  burnt  sample   of  at least 50 mm,  or a duration   of self-sustained   com-\nbustion   of  at least  3 min.",
