        },
        {
          "text": "For  all  materials,   with  the exception   of polyethylene,    C,_mis  less than  LOI;  therefore,\nupward  combustion   on  the ground   is more  of a fire hazard   than  \"candle-like\"   combustion   where  the flame  propa-\ngates  downward.",
