          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Based  on this  principle,   in order  to simulate\nmicrogravity    conditions   (namely,   the  absence   of natural  convection),   two  apparatuses   with  reduced   natural  convec-\ntion were  built  to calculate   V,,°:\n\n      •    Horizontal   Narrow-Channel     apparatus   (fig.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
