        {
          "text": "i Narrow-Channel    Apparatus   Schematic.--The     Narrow-Channel     apparatus  and  pertinent    test procedure    for\nmaterial-flammability      evaluations    in a suppressed   convection   environment    that  partially  models  the space  environ-\nment  were  patented   in Russia:  the  patent  license  has  number  2116093.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 11,
