          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  schematic   of the Narrow-Channel     apparatus   tor  V,,,,,evaluation    is shown  on  figure   1.7.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 11,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "A set  of meshes    is\ninstalled   in the chamber   of the apparatus   to provide  a uniform   flow  across  the chamber   cross-section.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 11,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  working\nchamber    is a flat  channel  between  two  massive  copper   plates  heavy  enough   to assure  a uniform   wail  temperature.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 11,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "A\ndistance  h between   upper  and lower  plates   is variable.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 11,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  sample   is mounted  on the  shaft.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 11,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  shaft  can be moved\nbackward   and  forward  by a drive,  keeping   the sample   in the midline   of the  channel.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 11,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "A gaseous  flow  with  prescribed\noxygen   concentration    prepared   in a mixer  flows  into  the  channel.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 11,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  flow  rate  is determined   by a flow-rate   meter\n(PC-3),  and the oxygen   concentration     is measured   by a gas  analyzer   (Zircon-M).",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 11,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The sample  edge   is kept  at a pre-\nscribed   distance  from  the meshes  by  the drive.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 11,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The sample   is ignited  outside   before   its insertion   into  the channel.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 11,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "To maintain   the  prescribed   flow  velocity,   a flow  calibration   in the Narrow  Channel  was  performed.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 11,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  flow\nvelocity  was  defined   using  a smoke-visualization      technique---the    movement   of a small smoke  blob  (size  of about\n5 mm)  over  a certain   distance   in the  location   of the sample.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 11,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "1.3.2 Procedure   and  Results   of Narrow  Channel   Testing.--The    Narrow  Channel   test  in the  apparatus   on  fig-\nure  1.7 evaluates   material   flammability    in terms  of  V,,,,, determined    at a prescribed   oxygen   concentration   C   (greater\nthan  C,,m).",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 11,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "through   the  following   steps:\n\n       •    define  h  based  on C   (a vertical   distance  between   horizontal   plates   is calculated   using  a special   formula);\n      •    mount  a sample  on  the  shaft  using  a special   fixture  (samples   of monolithic   materials   that  maintain   their\n          shape  and do not melt  are  strips  1 mm×  5 mmx   20 mm;  samples  of melting   materials   are mounted   using\n         mica  back-plates   0.3-mm   thick;  back-plate    size  is 6 × 60 mm);  all samples   are installed   in the channel\n           midline,    i.e.,the   distance  from  the sample   to upper  and  to lower  plate  shall  be the same:\n      •     create  a oxygen-nitrogen     mixture  flow  of prescribed    velocity  and oxygen   concentration     in the Narrow\n         Channel   (the  gaseous   mixture   is prepared    in the  mixer);\n       •     ignite  the sample  outside   the channel   in the flow  of gaseous  mixture  from  the channel   outlet;  when  com-\n           bustion  becomes   stable  (wait  for  at least  3 sec),  insert  the sample   into  the channel   with  a 10-ram  distance\n          from  the burning   front  edge  to the mesh:\n       •    monitor  combustion    closely;   record  sample  shape  changes:   maintain   the combustion   zone  in the channel\n           midline;\n\n\n\nNASA/CR--    1999-209405                                  7",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 11,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "•   defineV_,mformaterialsburningwithoutrigidcharformationastheflowvelocitywherethedurationof\n       self-sustainedcombustionisatleast20sec;\n     •   defineV,,,,formaterialsburningwithrigidcharformationastheflowvelocitywherethedurationof\n       self-sustainedcombustionisatleast10sec.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 12,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Ordinarily,toeliminatetheeffectofresidualnaturalconvection,theapparatusismountedhorizontally.How-\never.anewmethodologywasdevelopedtominimizeadiscrepancybetweenV,,.,obtainedinthespaceexperiment\nonMir and  V,,., evaluated   in the Narrow  Channel.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 12,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "To accomplish    this,  the Narrow-Channel      test  is done  twice---in   a\nhorizontal   and  a vertical   position   of the  apparatus,   and  the  lesser  value  of the two  results   is accepted   as the  best  es-\ntimate  o1\"the unknown   limiting  flow  velocity.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 12,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Limiting   flow  velocities  were  evaluated   in the Narrow-Channel     apparatus   at oxygen   concentrations    of 21 and\n23  percent,  which  correspond    to the actual  oxygen  concentration    on Mir  during  the space  testing   of 1994 and  1996.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 12,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  results  obtained   are  in table   !.2,  which  shows  that,  as oxygen   concentration    increases.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 12,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
