          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  results  obtained   at Keldysh   Research   Center  and  at All-Russia    Institute   for Fire\nSafety  agree  in general   ranking,   despite  some  differences    in the numerical   values.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
