        },
        {
          "text": "1.4 Flame  Propagation   Along  the  Material   Surface   in the Narrow  Channel   Apparatus\n\n     Thermoplastic    polymer   testing   in the Narrow-Channel    apparatus   showed   that a collar  of melting   material  forms\non  the edge  of the sample.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 12,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  molten  material   accumulates,   and  its mass  increases  during  the  test.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 12,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  time  T_,from\nthe moment   of material   ignition   to the moment  when  the drop  of molten  material   touches   the lower  plate  of the Nar-\nrow Channel    is important.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 12,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "This  time  characterizes    indirectly   the viscosity   of the melt  and  helps  to  predict  material\n\nNASA/CR--    1999-209405                                  8",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 12,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
