          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  video  tapes  provide   the tollowing   information:     \"r, - the time  from  ignition   to a moment  when  the flame\nfront  propagates   through   a half  of a sample;  and  \"_.- the time  of flame  quenching    at flow  shutoff   (zero  flow  veloc-\nity).",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 14,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Both  times  depend  on sample  thermal  deformation.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 14,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Deformation    promotes   flame-spread    rate  increase   in the\ndownstream    direction,   which  leads  to a flame-size   increase.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 14,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  Delrin  sample  has  the  longest  quenching   time  \"_,,\nabout  2 min,  while  the  size  of the  flame  zone  stays  small.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 14,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "1.5.2  Skorost  Testing   - Combustion-Chamber      Horizontal   Orientation.--Figures          !.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 14,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "12 and  1.13 show  examples\nof sample  combustion   when  Skorost   is oriented   horizontally.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 14,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The flame  shape  during  the  initial  phase  of combustion\nis close  to that  observed   in the space  experiment   (although   asymmetrical    due  to buoyancy).",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 14,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "In comparison    to  that\nobserved   in the Skorost   vertical   orientation,   the sample  deformation     starts  earlier  and  progresses    faster.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 14,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "In 10 to\n15 sec  after  ignition,   the  heated  portion  of the sample  bends  down  under  the  effect  of gravity.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 14,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The sample  bending\ncompletely   changes   the combustion   and flow  pattern  around   the sample.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 14,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "However,   some  V,  data  have  been  obtained\nduring  the  initial  phase  of combustion.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 14,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Thus,  a flame-propagation    rate  for Delrin,  when  the  gravity   force  is perpen-\ndicular   to the sample   axis and  flow-velocity    vector,  increases   to 0.8 mm/s   for the strip  sample  and  to 0.35  to\n0.4 mm/s  for the  cylindrical   sample,    i.e., a flame-propagation      rate almost  twice  compared   to the  rate when  the\nchamber    is oriented   vertically.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 14,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  time  '_, for Delrin   is one-third    that  of the  vertical-orientation     case,  which  may  be\nexplained  by  the  larger  size  of the  flame.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 14,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Similarly.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 14,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "high-density   polyethylene    and PMMA  samples  show  qualitative\nreductions   in combustion   and  extinguishment    times  in the horizontal    orientation   compared    to those  in the  vertical\norientation.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 14,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "1.6 Selection   of  Materials,  Sample   Shape,  and  Test Modes   for  the Space  Experiment\n\n     Material-flammability      evaluation    in space   is feasible    if,  firstly,  a sample  can be ignited  and  samplecombustion\nis stable  until  a prescribed   amount   of sample  material    is consumed    at the oxygen   concentration   on the Mir  atmos-\nphere;  and.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 14,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "secondly,   the flow  velocity   in the combustion   chamber    is higher  than  a limiting   velocity   V,I., for  this\nmaterial.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 14,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Hence,   all  materials   shall  be flammable    at C  = 21 percent  and  a flow  velocity   less than  20 cm/s,  or:\n\n                                         Co_> Ch,oand V > V,,m;\n\nwhere C   (percent)    is the oxygen   concentration    in the Mir compartment,      C,,,, (percent)    is the  limiting  oxygen  con-\ncentration    to sustain  material   combustion,  V (cm/s)   is the  velocity   of the flow  in the combustion   chamber,  and  V,,m\n(cm/s)   is the  limiting   velocity  of the flow  to  sustain  material  combustion.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 14,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Figure  1.14 shows  a relation  among   velo-\ncities,  mentioned   above.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 14,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  shaded  area describes   the environment     that  is most  likely  to occur  during  the  flight:  a\n\n\nNASA/CR--    1999-209405                                 10",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 14,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
