          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Vrangefromnearzeroto25cm/s,andaC rangefrom21to23percent.Dataandtheextrapolationsshownon\nfigure1.14arebasedontheresultsoftheNarrow-Channeltests,table1.2.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 15,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Figure1.14showsthatDelrin(datacurve1),PMMA3,andhigh-densitypolyethylene4characteristicsare\nwithinthisshadedarea;therefore,thespacexperimentispossibleonMir,  and  a limiting   flow  velocity   V,,,, and  a\nflame-spread    rate V_ for these  materials   can be obtained.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 15,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "As noted,  the  cylindrical   samples  maintain   their  shape\nlonger:   therelbre,    this shape   is preferred   for the space  experiment.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 15,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  results  of the  previous   Skorost   testing  of PMMA  on Mir suggest   that  values  shown  in  table  1.2 and on  fig-\nure  1.14 may  be higher  than  actual  data  obtained   in Skorost  during  the space   test.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 15,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "However,    V,,,, from  table  1.2 was\ntaken  as the  first approximation     for the flow  velocity   setting  in the  Skorost  combustion   chamber  on Mir  for V,m\nevaluation.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 15,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Table   1.5 describes   in general   the space   test procedure   on Mir  for the three  selected   materials,   Delrin,   high-\ndensity   polyethylene,    and PMMA   at an oxygen   concentration    of 21 percent   in the Mir  compartment.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 15,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  material\nignition  occurs   at flow  velocities   2 to 3 cm/s  higher  than V,Lmfrom  table   1.2.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 15,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The   first  set of samples  were  tested\naccording   to Skorost  ground  testing   timeline,   described   above.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 15,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
