        {
          "text": "1.7 Skorost  Special  Testing\n\n     The  objectives   of the Skorost   special   testing  with  tour  filters  was:\n\n       •     to familiarize   the crew  with  the  apparatus;\n       •     to develop   the space-experiment      test procedure;   and\n       •     to assess  crew  fire and  toxicology    safety.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
