          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Samples   of the compartment   atmosphere   were  taken  through   probes  for  analysis   at four  times  -------beforethe  test,\nhalf  a minute   after each  sample   ignition,   after  each  sample  extinguishment,    and  at  the end  of the  test.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
