          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Table   1.6 shows  the  results  of the gaseous  environment    analysis   at the Skorost   outlet  and\nin the Space  Station  compartment    (mock-up),   when  the Space  Station  air-quality    control  system   is not working.",
