          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The   first  portion  of the sample  was  burned   at V = 1 cm/s,\nand combustion   time  from  ignition   to the moment  when  the fan was  switched  was 58  sec.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 18,
