        },
        {
          "text": "TEST  RESULTS  AND DISCUSSION  ON COMBUSTION   OF SAMPLES   IN MICROGRAVITY\n\n     According    to the  test  timeline,    test conditions   were  changed  when  the flame   front  propagates   the given  fraction\nof the sample  length  L either  (I/2)  x  I, (I/3)  x  l, or (2/3)  x  l.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
