          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  flow  velocity   during  the  test was changed  from  highest   to lowest,  or to  zero.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 18,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  points  where  the  fan\nwas  to be switched  was  indicated  by  concentric   marks  on the  samples.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 18,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "When  the  front  of the flame  got  to the  last\nmark,  the flow  was  stopped,    i.e.,  the  fan was  turned  off, and  the  shutter   at the combustion   chamber   inlet  was  closed.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 18,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Then  the sample  quenching   time  \"c,was  measured.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 18,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
