        },
        {
          "text": "3.1VerificationofGroundCalibrationofFlowinSkorost  by Vortex  Movement    in the PMMA  Flame\n\n      Usually,   four  filters   at the Skorost   outlet  are used  to avoid  space  compartment    contamination    with  hazardous\n combustion    products,   namely,  two  sets  of gas mask   filters  (of \"M\"  and \"BKF\"  type),  connected   in  series.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 19,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "However,\n due to technical  problems   during  delivery,   the  flight  Skorost  used  for the space  experiment   was equipped   with two\n filters  (one  set)  only.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 19,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 19,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "one  of the  Skorost  exhaust   outlets  was  sealed  during  the apparatus   assembly   on\norbit.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 19,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Additional    safety  testing  verified   that  Skorost   with two  filters  is  still  in compliance   with crew  safety  require-\nments,  but  the flow  velocity   in Skorost  combustion   chamber   decreased   significantly.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 19,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Figure   1.5 shows  the  results  of flow  calibrations,   which  were  repeated  on the ground  with  the  test Skorost   appa-\nratus  equipped   with two  filters.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 19,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  flow  velocity  was measured    at a low  power  supplied   to Skorost  from  the Mir\nPower  Supply  System   (25.9  V), as was  the  case on Mir during  the space  experiment.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 19,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "To have  the  hydraulic   resis-\ntance  in the  test Skorost   as close  to the hydraulic   resistance   in the  flight  Skorost  as possible,   the  sets  of meshes   in the\ntest Skorost  combustion   chamber   underwent    special   thermal   treatment   to clean  away  the combustion-product       resi-\ndue  left  after  the previous   testing.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 19,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Nevertheless,    because   the  test Skorost   apparatus  was  used  tbr ground   calibration\ninstead   of the  flight  one,  a velocity-field     identity  became  a concern.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 19,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "It  is known   that,  in microgravity    with  no buoyancy,   a velocity   of vortices  on the flame  border  characterizes    an\nair-flow   velocity.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 19,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The most  stable  vortices   are formed   in the PMMA   sample  flame.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 19,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  computer-aided    processing\nof the  videotape   provided   real-time   information   on the flow  velocity   during  the  test.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 19,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Figure   1.5 includes  a compari-\nson  of ground   calibration   data and  real-time   data  obtained   from  the  video.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 19,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  discrepancy    is within  the  error  of\nmeasurement     (I 0 to 15 percent);   theretbre,   ground   calibration   data on  the flow  velocity  during  the space  experiment\nare  applicable.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 19,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
