          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Despite   the\ngrowing   size  of the melt  ball,  the  material-destruction      rate V r- is constant   at 0.105  mm/s  for both V =  I and\n0.5 cm/s.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
