          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  size  of the\nmelt  drop  increases   rapidly  during  the  first  mode,  similar  to that  of Delrin  sample  #2,  up to dD= 2.0 at x = 90  sec.",
