        },
        {
          "text": "The  size  of the flame  increases   as  well and  reaches  D,:=  4.4 and  L,_= 4.8  at \"_= 90  s, with  a rate  of change   of the\nflame  length  shown  as 0.21  mm/s.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
