          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  material-destruction      rate V,_-shown   in the  figure  remains   the same  at 0.175  mm/s  tor  the V = 2 and\n0.3  cm/s  conditions,   but   it decreases   by almost  a factor  of two (0.075  cm/s)  after  x = 150 sec, when  a piece  of the\nPMMA  sample  #5 stuck  to the Sample  #3 and  the two samples   started  to burn  together.",
