          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  flame-front   propagation\nrate V, _ (not shown)  decreases   by almost  a factor  of three  (i.e.,  from  0.25  to 0.085  mm/s)  when  the flow  velocity\nchanges   from  2 to 0.3 cm/s.",
