          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  diameter   of the boiling   melt  drop  d,  increases\nconstantly   from  an  initial  1.0 to 2.0  at \"t= 60 sec  (the end  of the  first mode)  to 2.4  at \"_ = 160  (near  the end  of the\nsecond  mode).",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 20,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  size  of the flame  reaches  D_ = 4.5 and L_ = 6.5  at z = 60.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 20,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  flame-front    propagation    rate  V, _ is\n0.4  cm/s  during  the  first mode  (not shown   in the  figure).",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 20,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  material-destruction      rate  Vj  of 0.185   is the same  lbr\nboth  modes,  about  half  of the  flame-propagation      rate.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 20,
