          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  rear\npart of the flame  was  of a white  color  with  well-defined    border,  but  the front  part  of the flame  was  unstable,   red-\norange   in color,  with  a poorly-defined    border.",
