          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Bright\nspurts  were  also  visible.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 20,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "A high-temperature     zone,  visualized   by tiny  bubbles  appearing   in the  transparent  PMMA\nmaterial,  was  located   in front  of the main  swollen   collar  of melting   material.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 20,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiny  drops  of molten  material   were\nnoticeable   within   this  zone.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 20,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "These  drops  moved  away  from  the sample   axis;  but,  being  unable   to overcome   a sur-\nlace-tension    force,  they  returned   to the  points  of their  origin   (fig.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 20,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "3.18).",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 20,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Combustion   dynamics   for PMMA  sample  #5 are shown   in figure   3.5.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 20,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  melt-drop   diameter   d,, increases\ngradually   and  reaches   2.0 by r=  70  sec.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 20,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Simultaneously,    both  the diameter   and  length  of the  hemispherical    flame\nincrease   from  2.0  at r=  0 to 4.0  at 40  sec.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 20,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "After  that  time,  the  flame  diameter  remains   constant   at 4.0  to 4.1, but the\nlength  of the flame  continues   to increase   at a small  rate.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 20,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  flame-front   propagation    rate  is a constant   lbr  the  entire\ntest  at V_÷ = 0.26  mm/s,  but the  material-destruction      rate V_:-increases   from  0.06 mm/s  measured   during  the time\ninterval   of r= 20  to 45 sec  to 0.2  after  r=  45.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 20,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "NASA/CR--    1999-209405                                  16",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 20,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "3.2.6 PMMA  Sample  #6.--PMMA    sample  #6 was  tested   at a lower  flow  velocity  than PMMA  sample   #5.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 21,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "After\nabout  50 sec of the second   part  of the  test (V = 0.5  cm/s),  the  transparent   flame  extinguished   when  the  fan was  still\nworking.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 21,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  short  part  of the sample  before   the second  concentric   mark  remained   in the  initial  conditions,   without\nbubbles   in the transparent  PMMA   material.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 21,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Combustion   dynamics   for PMMA  sample  #6 are shown   in figure   3.6.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 21,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "During   the  initial  period  of combustion\n(r<  20  sec)  at V = 1 cm/s,  the drop  of melting   material   swells  rapidly   to a diameter   of 2.0  at r=  50 sec.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 21,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Simultane-\nously,  both  the diameter   and  length  of the flame  increase.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 21,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  gap between   the flame  and sample   surface   5,\nappears   to be constant   at a value  of about   1.2, as shown   in figure  3.6.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 21,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  analysis  of D_:, _:, and  d, shows  that  at r<  50 sec:\n\n                                           D, =d,,+ 24_\n\n     Hence,  an increase   in the PMMA   melt-ball   diameter   d_, leads  to an increase   in the flame  diameter   D,.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 21,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "From  figure  3.6,  the calculated   flame-front   propagation    rate  at V = 1 cm/s  appears   to be constant  and  equal  to\n0.35 mm/s  at r=  0 to 30 sec, which   is higher  than  the  rate  of 0.26  mm/s  for Sample  #5  at V = 2 cm/s.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 21,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "This  discrep-\nancy  might  be explained   by higher  oxygen   concentration     at the  test times  (23.6  percent   instead   of 22.5  percent).",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 21,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  gaseous   bubbles  formed   inside  the  transparent  PMMA  sample   in front  of the flame  zone  demonstrate    the\nthermal-wave    propagation.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 21,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "This  process  was  video  recorded.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 21,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  thermal-wave    propagation,   VHw,at V = 1 cm/s   is\nshown  in figure  3.6  as 0.43  mm/s.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 21,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "When  the flow  velocity   decreases   from  1 to 0.5  cm/s  at r=  80 sec,  both  V,_.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 21,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "and V,  decrease.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 21,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "(The  thermal-wave    propagation   went  to 0.09 mm/s;  the  material-destruction      rate went  to\n0.066  mm/s.)\n     During  the  first mode  of the  test,  the flame  was  white  and opaque   with  soot  formation;   and  the edge  of the sam-\nple was visible  only  in the moments   of bright  spurts.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 21,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "During   the second  mode,  the  flame  became  blue  and  transpar-\nent, and  the edge  of the sample  was  visible;  but  the low  contrast   of the video  did  not show  confidently    the  border  of\nan almost   invisible   flame.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 21,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Simultaneously,     the color  of the flame  changed   from  white-orange    to blue.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 21,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "3.2.7 PMMA  Sample  #7.--This    sample  was  burned   last, because    it was damaged.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 21,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The sample  was  bent;  and.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 21,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "therefore,     it was  ignited  from  the  side.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 21,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "However,   after  ignition  the flame  propagated   upstream   and  in 7 sec  reached\nthe front  edge  of the sample.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 21,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Under  the  effect  of concurrent    flow,  the  front  part  of the sample  created   a loop  with  a\nlarge  drop  of melting   material  formed.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 21,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Then  the sample  became   straight   again,  and combustion   was  similar   to that\nfollowing   a normal   ignition   (see  fig.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 21,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "3.19).",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 21,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Combustion   dynamics    |br PMMA  sample  #7  are shown   in figure   3.7.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 21,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "In the  first  mode,  the flow V is a maxi-\nmum  of  8.5 cm/s.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 21,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  flame  diameter   and  length  reach  values  of 4.4 and  7.4,  respectively.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 21,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  average   flame-front\npropagation    rate  V, _ is 0.73  ram/s,  and  the  material-destruction      rate  V,- of 0.135   is several  times  lower.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 21,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "In the  sec-\nond mode,  a new measurement    of the  coordinates    of the melting   front  along  the sample   surface  X Mis included.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 21,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The\nslope  of these  positions   determines    the  melt-front   propagation    rate V M, which  has  a constant   value  of 0.095  mm/s.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 21,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  material-destruction      rate  V,  decreases   during  the second  mode  to 0.105  mm/s.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 21,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Combustion    continues   for more\nthan  200 sec  at the V = 0.5  crn/s mode\n      3.2.8 PMMA  Sample  #8.--The    sample  was  tested  in three  different  modes,  but   it is unclear  due  to loss  of some\nvideo  data  when  the flow  velocity  changed   for the  third  mode.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 21,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  flame  extinguished     at  \"t = 205  sec (approxi-\nmately),  when  the flow  velocity  was  apparently   0.5 cm/s.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 21,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Just  before   that  time,  the sample   ignited  the  adjacent\nremainder   of Delrin  sample  #1.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 21,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Both  samples  burned   together   lbr a while.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 21,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Combustion   dynamics   for PMMA  sample  #8 are shown   in figure   3.8.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 21,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "During   the  first  mode,  the flame  diameter\nand  length  increase   greatly  by about  factors  of three.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 21,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  flame-front   propagation    rate  is 0.42  mm/s.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 21,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "and  the mate-\nrial-destruction     rate  is 0.24  mm/s.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 21,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "During   the second  mode,   the material-destruction      rate  decreases   to about  hall\" the\noriginal   rate.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 21,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "As  also  reported   for PMMA  Sample  #7, a melt-front   propagation    rate V M, is determined,   which   is of\nthe order  of 0.13  to 0.16  mm/s.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 21,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "3.2.9  Polyethylene   Sample   #9.--In    general,   the flame  was  white  in color,  due  to soot  particles,   and  elongated\n(fig.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 21,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "3.20).",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 21,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "When  the  fan was  turned  off and  the flow  velocity  decreased   from  8.5 cm/s  to zero,  the flame  length\ndecreased   rapidly,   especially   in the  portion  of the flame  that  is white.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 21,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "By A't = 3 sec, the flame  was  blue  and\ntransparent   with L_ = 2.8 and D_ = 2.6;  i.e.,  it acquired   a shape  close  to a hemisphere.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 21,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  flame  also  oscillated\nlongitudinally    with  a frequency   of about  1.2 Hz before  combustion   decayed   at A'_ = 10 sec  after  flow  shutoff.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 21,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "After\nextinguishment,    the combustion   chamber   was  filled  with  a thick  white  smoke,  which  consists   of the  products   of\npolyethylene    thermal   destruction.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 21,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "NASA/CR--     !",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 21,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "999-209405                                 17",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
