        },
        {
          "text": "CombustiondynamicsforSample#9areshowninfigure3.9.About25secafterignition,theflamebecomes\nsteady.D,  is 2.5,  while  L,_increases   at a constant   rate shown   to be of the  order  of 0.35  mm/s,  almost   until  flow  shut-\noff.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 22,
