        },
        {
          "text": "3.2.13  Flame-Front    Propagation-Rate    Summary.--Figure      3.21  presents   the  results  of the space  experiment    in\nterms  of the  variation   of the  flame-front   propagation    rate  Vf:÷with  the changes   in the velocity   of the flow V for the\n12 samples   of Delrin, PMMA,  and  polyethylene.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 22,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "V_\" decreases   rapidly  from  0.5-0.75   to 0.05-0.10   mm/s when  the\nflow  velocity   decreases   from V = 8.5  to V = 0.3-0.5  cm/s.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 22,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "This  pattern   leads  to a conclusion    that damping   of the\nvent  flow  in the space  station  compartment    will  suppress   the  fire  source   in microgravity.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 22,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
