          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "This phenomenon    can be explained   by the  fact  that  the flame  does  not\nsurround   the whole  drop  of  melt  in the Narrow   Channel,  which  decreases   the  heat  flux  to the sample  and  the flame-\npropagation     rate.",
