        },
        {
          "text": "The\nground   testing  of material   flammability    in the Narrow  Channel   apparatus   showed   that  at C  = 21 percent,  V_,m=\n0.50  cm/s  and  at Co_ = 23 percent,   V,,, = 0.30.",
