          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "When  the oxygen   concentration    increased   to C  = 23.6  percent  and\n25.4  percent   in the space  experiment,    Delrin  combustion   did  not stop  at V = 0.5 cm/s  (Sample   #2) and V = 0.3  cm/s\n(Samples   #3 and  #4),  respectively.",
