          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  flame  did not decay  when  the flow  velocity  was 2 cm/s  at\nC  = 22.5  percent    (i.e.,  V,,m< 2 cm/s),  nor when  the flow  velocity  was  0.75  at C_ = 25.4  percent   (V,,,, < 0.75  cm/s).",
