          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "That  means   that,  in microgravity    at low oxygen\nconcentrations    (C  = 21 percent),   diffusion    is not  sufficient   to sustain  combustion,   and  additional   oxygen   intake  by\nforced  convection    is required.",
