        },
        {
          "text": "3.4 Non-Steadiness    and Other  Characteristics    of Combustion    in Microgravity\n\n    The  nonsteadiness    of polymer   combustion    observed   in the space  experiment   might  be explained   by two\nreasons:   (1)  the formation   of the  melt  drop,  which   is almost   spherical   tbr  Delrin  and PMMA   (see  figs.",
