        },
        {
          "text": "5.RECOMMENDATIONSONCONTINUINGRESEARCHONFLAMMABILITYOF\n                NONMETALLICMATERIALSINMICROGRAVITY\n\n   Aswasnotedinreference9,themainobstacletocreatingareliablefire-safetysysteminthepressurizedcom-\npartmentsofInternationalSpaceStationmodulesisthelimitedunderstandingoftheunusualcharacteristicsofthe\nprocessofcombustionofsolidsinmicrogravity.Combustionofthermallythinlayersoffuel(sheetsof paper\n~0.l-ramthick)hasbeentheprimarystudyinexperiments.Thisisduetotheshorttimer,duringwhichit ispossi-\nbletomaintainastateofweightlessnessinfreefallingroundfacilities(r< 10secindroptowersandr< 25secin\nlaboratoryaircraft).Thedataobtainedareundoubtedlyofgreattheoreticalinterest,butasarule,materialsinthe\nformofthermallythicklayersareusedinrealstructures.Forcombustiontests,theserequireamuchlongerduration\nofweightlessness,whichcanonlybeprovidedduringexpensiveandcomparativelyrareflightsofsoundingrockets\n(r= 6to 10min)andspacecraft(r---->_).",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 25,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore,    in  all, only  six materials   in the form  of specimens   with  a sufficiently    large  cross-section    have  been\ntested  to date  under  conditions    of prolonged   weightlessness     (refs.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 25,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "2, 3, 28 to  30), and three  of these  were  tested  in\nthe  last  series  of combustion   experiments   on  the Skorost   experimental    unit  aboard  the Mir  Space  Station.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 25,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  results\nare analyzed   in this  report  and are  presented   as reports   to the  Fifth  International   Microgravity    Combustion   Work-\nshop  held  in May  1999  in Cleveland   U.S.A.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 25,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "(refs.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 25,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "29 and  30).",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 25,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "As was  noted  in reference   30, ground   facilities   with  a\nreduced   natural-convection      effect   (the Narrow  Channel  experimental    unit)  can  apparently   be used  only  for com-\nparative   testing  of the flammability    of materials.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 25,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Most  often,  experiments    in weightlessness    have  investigated   the combustion    of a reference   or model  material\n(PMMA,   polymethylmethacrylate),       the thermal  and  kinetic  characteristics    of which  have  been  studied   in the  greatest\ndetail.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 25,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Planar  specimens    (plates  with  width  b = 8 mm and  thicknesses   h = 1, 2, and 3 mm)  were  tested  in the  first\nseries  of space  experiments   on  the  Skorost  experimental    unit  aboard   the Mir  Space  Station   (ref.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 25,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "2).",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 25,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "It was  observed\nthat  the flame  was  not extinguished     at a velocity  V of the oncoming   flow  that  (as per updated   data)  exceeded   5 cm/s.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 25,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  flame  was  extinguished    only when  the flow  decayed   after  the  fan had been  switched   off.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 25,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "In the second   series\nof space  experiments   on  the same  apparatus   aboard   the Mir Space   Station,  burning  planar  specimens   of PMMA\n(b = 2 mm)  were  extinguished   when  the  air-flow   rate  with  an oxygen   concentration   C  = 21.5  percent  decreased   to\nV = 0.5 cm/s.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 25,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "This  agrees  with  the  results  of  this  study,  which  find  that a limiting   velocity  V_,,o= 0.5 cm/s  at C  =\n23.6  percent   for  cylindrical   specimens   with  diameter  d = 4.5 mm.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 25,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "A tendency   for extinction   of a flame  on  the  sur-\nface  ofa PMMA  specimen   with  thickness   h = 3.2 mm  in a stagnant   atmosphere   with  a very  high  oxygen   concentra-\ntion C  = 50 percent   at p = 202  kPa  (2 atm)  was  observed   in experiments    under  the  Solid  Surface  Combustion\nExperiments   program   (ref.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 25,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "28).",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 25,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Thus,   at least  tor the  reference   material  (PMMA),   the results  of the space  experiments   confirmed   the presence\nof a lower  velocity   limit  for combustion    V,,mpredicted   by the  theory   (refs.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 25,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "11 and  12).",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 25,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "However,     it should  be noted\nthat  the  velocity   V,,,,,only  characterizes    the combustion    limit  lbr specimens  made  of the same  material   and  with  the\nsame  geometrical    shape.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 25,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Figure  5.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 25,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "I presents   the results  of numerical   calculations   from   (ref.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 25,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "I 1) on  the combustion    limits  of PMMA   in\nthe  vicinity   of the  stagnation   point  of the oncoming   flow  of a gaseous  mixture  containing   oxygen.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 25,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  results  are  in\nthe Ibrm  of a map  of the mass  concentration    of oxygen  C   in the oncoming   gas flow  as a function   of the  velocity\ngradient   of the  external  flow  at the  critical   (stagnation)    point  a (the  derivative   of the  tangential   component    of the gas\nvelocity  u calculated   in the  direction   of the  axis  of the  streamlined   body),  which  characterizes    the flow  in the  vicin-\nity of the  critical   point.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 25,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  velocity   at the  border  of  the boundary   layer  increases   linearly  with  the  distance  x from\nthe  critical   point,   i.e., u = ax.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 25,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  values  of the inverse   dimensionless    diagnostic    variable,   the Damk6hler   number\n\n                                              Da=    fl/  a\n\nare  actually   plotted  along  the  x-axis  of the graph   in figure  5.1,  where  ,6 is the modified   pre-exponential     factor  in the\nexpression    for the  rate  of the chemical   reaction   (ref.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 25,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "I i ).",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 25,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  Damk6hler   number   is the  ratio  of the  characteristic\ngas-dynamic    time,  which   is proportional    to  1/a,  to the  characteristic    chemical-reaction     time, which   is proportional    to\n 1//3.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 25,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "If the  value  of/3   is fixed,  which  corresponds    to the combustion    of any one  selected   material,   then  the  tollowing\nrelation   is  valid.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 25,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Da 1 ~ a\n\nNASA/CR--   1999-209405                                 21",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 25,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  results  of the calculations   show  that  the relative   role  of heat losses  to radiation   from  the  surface  of the  solid\nbody  increases   as the  velocity   gradient  a decreases.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 26,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "This  leads  to a decrease   in the  temperature    of the flame  and\nextinction   of the flame  as a result  of the  decrease   in the  rate  of the chemical   reaction.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 26,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "If there  is no radiation   from\nthe  surface  (emissivity   e = 0), then  only  the upper  velocity   limit  of combustion    is observed----the   flame   is extin-\nguished   at low  Damk6hler   numbers   because   the time  that  the  reacting   particles  remain   in the reaction   zone becomes\nnegligible   with  respect   to the characteristic    chemical-reaction     time  (\"flame   blowout\").",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 26,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  velocity   gradient  a at the  critical  point  is a function   of both  the  velocity  of the oncoming   flow V and  the\ncharacteristic    dimension   d and shape  of the  streamlined   body.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 26,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "For  example:\n\n       •    For a streamlined    sphere,  a = 3V/d;\n       •    For a streamlined    cylinder   perpendicular     to  its generatrix,   a = 4V/d;\n       •    For  a streamlined    disk  along  the normal   to its plane,  a = nV/2d.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 26,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "As the  calculation    results  given  in figure  5.1 show,   at a given  oxygen   concentration    Co_, the flame   is extin-\nguished   in the  vicinity   of the  critical  point  at a definite,   fixed  value  a.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 26,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Hence,    it tollows   that  the combustion    velocity\nlimit  V,lmchanges   proportionally     to the  characteristic    dimension   of the upstream   side  of the  streamlined   body.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 26,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "This\nmeans   that  V,,,, is not constant   for a material   at a given  concentration    of oxidizer,   but  rather   it is dependent   on the\nstreamlining    conditions   and the  characteristic    linear  dimension    of the  body  (the  scale  factor),   in  particular.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 26,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "As  is noted  above,   little  reliable  experimental    data  are  available   to date on the combustion    limits  of non-\nmetallic   materials   in microgravity    in order  to generalize   them  to obtain  a theoretical   Damk6hler   number.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 26,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Space\nexperiments    should  be continued   with  variation   of the Damk6hler   number  through   selection   of materials   with  dif-\nferent  combustion    reaction-rate    constants  and  variation   of the  cross-section    of the specimens.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 26,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Above   all,  it is necessary   to study  the  effect  of the scale  factor.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 26,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "For  this  purpose,   flammability    tests  should  be\nconducted   on  cylindrical   specimens   with  various  diameters   (d = 2 to 8 mm).",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 26,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Here,  based  upon  the  results  of ground\nexperiments,      it is necessary   to  select  materials   for which  the  velocity   limit  for combustion   Vhmis higher  than  those\nof the melting   thermoplastic   polymers   tested  in  this work.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 26,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "As  the results  from  the second   series  of experiments   on\nthe  Skorost  experimental    unit  aboard   the Mir  Space  Station  show   (ref.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 26,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "3),  the fiberglass   and  fabric-based    laminates\nused  extensively    in the  pressurized   compartments    of the ISS  modules  may  be suitable   for  this  purpose.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 26,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "A study  of the combustion    of nonmetallic    materials   with  only  frontal   ventilation   of the specimens   could  be con-\nducted  on the  Skorost   experimental    unit.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 26,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Of course,   this  is the most  hazardous  mode  of streamlining   from  the  fire\nstandpoint,   but  questions   regarding   the outbreak   of  fire on  the  lateral  surface   structural   elements   are also  of great\ninterest.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 26,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "It has been  demonstrated    in theoretical   works  that two  flame   fronts  are formed  immediately    after  ignition,\nand  these  fronts  spread  in opposite   directions   along  the surface   of a thermally   thin  layer  of  fuel.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 26,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  trailing  edge  of\nthe  flame,  which  moves  downstream,     is less  intense  than  the leading  edge,  and  it soon  degenerates   because   of  insuf-\nficient  oxygen  inflow   into  this  area.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 26,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "As a result,   at a certain  time  after  ignition,   the flame  spreads  only  in the  direc-\ntion  opposite   to the slow-moving    flow  of oxidizing   gas  (ref.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 26,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "31 ).",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 26,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  theoretical    results  presented   need  to be verified  by experiments    under  natural  conditions;    but,  to do  so,  the\nSkorost   experimental    unit must  be modernized   by expanding     its experimental     capabilities   and by eliminating    the\ncircuit  and  structural   deficiencies    that were  revealed   during  the  operations   of the  present  model.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 26,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "In order  to make  the modernized   Skorost-M   unit  universal   and  suitable   for conducting    studies  on combustion    in\na downstream   flow  in microgravity    both  on the  front  and  the  lateral  surfaces   of specimens,    the design  of the  ignit-\ning devices   will be changed,   and  these  devices   will be tucked  into  special   niches  to increase   the  uniformity   and  sta-\nbility  of the  flow.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 26,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "When  the combustion   chamber   of the  Skorost  experimental    unit  is modernized,      it is proposed    that  the diameter\nof  the rotating  drums  be increased  by a factor  of  1.5 (from  60  to 90 mm),  and  accordingly,    the  cross-section    of the\ncombustion   chamber   be increased  by a factor  of  1.5 (from  80×  150  to  i 10 × 200 mm).",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 26,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "This  will  make   it possible\nto prevent   the  undesirable   heating   effect  of a burning  specimen  on neighboring   specimens   as observed   in these\nexperiments,    and  it will  also make   it possible   to expand   the flow  nucleus   in the combustion   chamber.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 26,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "An  increase   in\nthe  distance   between   specimens   by a factor  of  1.5 is also  necessary    to expand  the  field  of view  of the compact   inter-\nferometer   with  a laser-light   source  proposed   for Skorost-M.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 26,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "in order  to determine   the  temperature    fields  in the flame\nzone  of specimens   burning   in microgravity.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 26,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "This  will markedly   increase   the  information    that can  be derived  from\nexpensive   space  experiments.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 26,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "NASA/CR--    1999-209405                                 22",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 26,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "CONCLUSION\n\n    ThethirdseriesofspaceexperimentintheSkorost   apparatus  was  conducted   and  videotaped    in October   of\n1998  on the  Orbital   Station  Mir.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 27,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The combustion    of twelve   selected   cylindrical   samples   of three  plastic   materials,\nDelrin, PMMA,  and  high-density    polyethylene,   was  observed   in microgravity.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 27,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  diameter   of each  sample  was\n4.5 mm,  the flow  velocity  was from  0.3  to 8.5 cm/s,  and oxygen   concentration   was  elevated   (ranging   from  22.5  to\n25.4  percent).",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 27,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  characteristics    of melting   material  combustion   were  identified   in microgravity    for the modes  close  to lim-\niting.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 27,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  limiting   flow  velocities   were  obtained   for  tested  materials:\n\n       •     for PMMA,   V,,o, = 0.5 cm/s  at C  = 23.6  percent;\n       •     for polyethylene,   V,,m= 0.3  - 0.5 cm/s  at C  = 25.4  percent:\n       •     for Delrin,  V,,m< 0.3 cm/s  at C  = 25.4  percent.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 27,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  values  for a limiting   flow  velocity  obtained   in the space  experiment   appear  to be lower  that  the  values\nobtained   in the ground   testing  with  apparatus   with  suppressed   convection    (horizontal   Narrow  Channel).",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 27,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "It has been  demonstrated     that  at flow  shutoff  the  extinction    in microgravity    occurs  in 5 to 20  s, which   is signifi-\ncantly  lower  than  the extinction   time  obtained   during  the ground   testing.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 27,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The  shorter  extinction   time  is favorable   lot\nfire-safety   system  operation   in space  compartments,    where  the  fire-system   response    is based  on vent-flow    shutoff.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 27,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "It has been shown   that.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 27,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "if the  concurrent   flow  velocity  V decreases,   the  flame-spread    rate V_ will  decrease,   from\nV, = 0.5  to 0.75  mm/s  at V = 8.5 cm/s  to V,: = 0.05  to 0.01 mm/s  at V = 0.3  to 0.5 cm/s.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 27,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Based  on the  analysis  of data  obtained  on nonmetallic    material   flammability    in space,   it is proposed   to continue\nthe space-experiment    program   in Skorost  and  Skorost-M.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 27,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
