        },
        {
          "text": "DISTRIBUTION/AVAILABILITY  STATEMENT                                                     12b.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 60,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "DISTRIBUTION CODE\n\n         Unclassified       - Unlimited\n        Subject    Category:    27                                               Distribution:       Nonstandard\n\n        This  publication    is available  from  the NASA  Center  for AeroSpace   Information,   (301) 621-0390\n  13.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 60,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "ABSTRACT (Maximum 200 words)\n\n       The   flammability       in  microgravity      of  three   U.S.-furnished        materials,     Delrin,    polymethylmethacrylate        (PMMA),     and\n        high-density      polyethylene,     was  determined     using   a Russian-developed        combustion      tunnel   on  Mir.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 60,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Four  4.5-mm-diameter\n         cylindrical     samples    of  each   plastic   were   ignited   under   concurrent     airflow    (in  the  direction    of  flame   spread)    with   velocities\n       from  no  flow   to  8.5  cm/s.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 60,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "The   test  results    identify    a limiting    air-flow    velocity    Vii m for  each   material,    below   which\n       combustion      ceases.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 60,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Nominal     values   are  Vii m <0.3  cm/s   for  Deirin,    0.5  cm/s   for PMMA,    and  0.3  to  0.5  cm/s   for  polyethyl-\n        ene.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 60,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "These   values    are  lower   than   those   obtained     in  prior  ground    testing.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 60,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Nevertheless,      they  demonstrate       that  flow   shutoff\n          is  effective     for  extinguishment        in  the  mierogravity      environment      of  spacecraft.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 60,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Microgravity       test  results    also  show   that   the\n         plastic    materials    maintain    a stable   melt   ball  within    the  spreading    flame   zone.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 60,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "In  general,    as  the  concurrent     flow   velocity\n     V  decreases,     the  flame-spread       rate V F decreases,    from   an  average    (for   all  three   materials)     of V F =  0.5-0.75   mm/s    at\n     V = 8.5  cm/s   to V F = 0.05-0.01    mm/s    at V = 0.3-0.5    cm/s.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 60,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "Also,   as V decreases,     the  flames   become     less   visible   but\n        expand,    increasing     the  probability     of  igniting   an  adjacent     surface.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 60,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
          "evidence_type": "extracted_source_text",
          "research_status": "unclassified",
          "classification_basis": "No recognized page heading found.",
          "classification_status": "requires_manual_review",
          "experimental_result_status": "not_established",
          "scientific_findings_verified": false,
          "nasa_id": "20000024924",
          "title": "Experimental Verification of Material Flammability in Space",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924"
        },
        {
          "text": "14.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 60,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20000024924",
          "matched_terms": [],
