          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/19960008387"
        },
        {
          "text": "It  is also  evident    that  the  radiative    effects  on spread   rate\n\ndecrease    as  the  ambient   pressure    is reduced    or  Vg  is increased.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
