          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/19960008387"
        },
        {
          "text": "Temperature    recorded  by a thermocouple    embedded     in  the  solid  and  a gas-\nphase   thermocouple     7 mm  above   the  surface  are superposed    on  these  photos   after  converting    time  into  distance\nassuming    the  flame  to be  steady.",
