          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/19960008387"
        },
        {
          "text": "If this  is also  true  at 1.5 atm,  the\nflame   size  must   increase   with  the  ambient    pressure,   a conclusion    predicted   from  the model   with  radiation    [5].",
