          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20210017787"
        },
        {
          "text": "The thermo-physical property values for cotton are assumed\nconstant and as follows: k=0.0552 W/mK, ρ=417 kg/m3, and cp=1380 J/kgK [26].",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
