          "title": "Determining the Cause of Reduced Concurrent Flame Spread over Thin Solid Fuels in Low Pressure and Low Gravity",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20210017787"
        },
        {
          "text": "correlations and two   kinetic models where used:\n                                                                   infinitely fast chemistry and finite rate chemistry, to\nevaluate situations when chemistry may be slower or comparable to transport processes (i.e.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 4,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20210017787",
