          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20210017787"
        },
        {
          "text": "This ignition time is varied linearly with pressure following the experiments (between 3\nand 10 s for ambient pressured ranging from 100 to 30 kPa, respectively).",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 4,
