          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20210017787"
        },
        {
          "text": "Experimentally, the position of the pyrolysis front was defined as the point where the fabric is first visibly\nblackened as it propagates over the material.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 4,
