          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20210017787"
        },
        {
          "text": "Microgravity experiments obtained during the Saffire II test\n                                                              can be directly related to the flame size/height[39] for another cotton-based fabric (Sibal) are included in here for\n                                                            and the portion of the material that is burningreference.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
