          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20210017787"
        },
        {
          "text": "Figure 10: FDS simulation results showing heat release rate (HRR) of a spreading flame under different gravity\nlevels.",
          "source_field": "pdf_page_text",
          "pdf_page_number": 10,
          "source_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20210017787",
