          "title": "Determining Flame Temperature By Broadband Two Color Pyrometry in A Flame Spreading Over A Thin Solid in Microgravity",
          "citation_url": "https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20220012861"
        },
        {
          "text": "Aiming to expand the knowledge of fire spread and\ngrowth, and material flammability in spacecraft en-\nvironments, NASA embarked on a research project,\nthe Spacecraft Fire Experiment (Saffire) [3], that aims\nto better understand material flammability and fire\ngrowth and spread.",
